<title>USA: CCC buys 56,229 T U.S. HRW wheat for Ethiopia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 56,229 T U.S. HRW wheat for Ethiopia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said on Friday it bought 56,229 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat under the export donation program to Ethiopia.</p>
<p>The wheat was acquired from Farmland Industries Inc at $175.73 a tonne, FOB, out of Galveston, Texas.</p>
<p>Shipment was set for November 1-25.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
